<title>ISRAEL: Israel's Q2 GDP +1.6 pct vs +2.0 in Q1.</title>
<headline>Israel's Q2 GDP +1.6 pct vs +2.0 in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's Central Bureau of Statistics released on Sunday the following data:</p>
<p>		     (percent change in annual terms)</p>
<p>		     Q2 97  Q1 97  Q2 96  6-MTH 97  6-MTH 96</p>
<p>GDP		  +1.6   +2.0   +3.5   +1.8	 +4.0</p>
<p>GDP per capita   -0.5   +0.2   +1.1   -0.4	 +1.4</p>
<p>Business sector</p>
<p>product	    +2.5   +0.5   +2.3   +1.4	 +4.9</p>
</text>
